  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Governance for Growth Phase 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Governance for Growth Program Phase 3 is a platform for policy dialogue between Australia and Vanuatu, supporting the analytical and consultative processes that inform policy formulation, as well as providing resources for policy implementation. The program is guided by two core objectives: Government acting with the private sector, conceives and implements change in policy and practice that encourages inclusive economic growth; and public expenditure delivers services that are more effective. The program deploys a range of modalities based on the needs and objectives of the specific reform project. These include: Direct Financing Arrangement with government agencies; directly engaged technical assistance; partnerships with Multilateral Development Banks, regional Australian programs, international organizations.</narrative>
  </description>
